# DigitalGuardian area 53: the melee and jump states (MeleeAttackTelegraph fn_14_8CCC, MeleeAttack
# fn_14_89D4, JumpAttack fn_14_8580) and their codes (SelectBestMeleeAttackLeg fn_14_7504,
# SelectMeleeAttackRange fn_14_73D4, SetJumpFaceTarget fn_14_7208). 0x11D8/0x11DC start at -1 (the
# ctor), so the no-leg arms run first, then the leg without a range, then both.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f140 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f160 objs Waypoint
@f170 obj e00350060
# no leg (0x11D8 -1): the telegraph and the attack are over at once
@f200 fsm e00350060 MeleeAttackTelegraph
@f260 fsm e00350060 MeleeAttack
@f320 obj e00350060
# a leg, no range (0x11DC -1): the attack is over at once
@f340 codecall e00350060 SelectBestMeleeAttackLeg
@f345 fsm e00350060 MeleeAttack
@f400 obj e00350060
# the body next to the player: leg and range, the telegraph, then the FSM's own way on
@f420 place e00350060 player 8
@f430 codecall e00350060 SelectBestMeleeAttackLeg; codecall e00350060 SelectMeleeAttackRange
@f435 fsm e00350060 MeleeAttackTelegraph
@f520 obj e00350060
@f600 obj e00350060
# the attack with the range both ways (near: 0, far: 1)
@f700 place e00350060 player 4
@f710 codecall e00350060 SelectBestMeleeAttackLeg; codecall e00350060 SelectMeleeAttackRange
@f715 fsm e00350060 MeleeAttack
@f800 obj e00350060
@f900 place e00350060 player 40
@f910 codecall e00350060 SelectBestMeleeAttackLeg; codecall e00350060 SelectMeleeAttackRange
@f915 fsm e00350060 MeleeAttack
@f1000 obj e00350060
# the jump: face target from several body positions, then the state
@f1100 codecall e00350060 SetJumpFaceTarget
@f1110 place e00350060 player 20; codecall e00350060 SetJumpFaceTarget
@f1120 place e00350060 player -20; codecall e00350060 SetJumpFaceTarget
@f1130 place e00350060 player 60; codecall e00350060 SetJumpFaceTarget
@f1140 place e00350060 player -60; codecall e00350060 SetJumpFaceTarget
@f1150 tp 0 0 0; codecall e00350060 SetJumpFaceTarget
@f1200 fsm e00350060 JumpAttack
@f1300 obj e00350060
@f1400 obj e00350060
@f1500 objs Guardian
@f1520 covdump
